@startuml c4_context
title System Context - AI Student Success and Dropout-Risk Support System

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Advisor" as Advisor
actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Data / ML Engineer" as Engineer

rectangle "AI Student Success and Dropout-Risk Support System\n(Web dashboard and prediction service)" as System {
  note as SystemNote
    Decision-support estimates and explanations only.
    The system does not make decisions about students.
    Synthetic/demo identities are used.
  end note
}

cloud "UCI ML Repository\nPublic student outcome dataset" as UCI

Advisor --> System : Reviews synthetic records and estimates\nRecords support follow-up
Admin --> System : Manages demo access\nReviews reports, audit records, and exports
Engineer --> System : Evaluates and publishes model versions
Engineer --> UCI : Obtains public dataset
System --> UCI : Dataset source for model development

@enduml
